; MAPA (automap) - Select in PLAY (or MAPA in the pause menu). Full screen: the window is hidden
; and the back buffer is drawn with 18 rows (BG map rows 8-25, SCY 64, SCX 0); 5 frames of copy.
; Row 0 title "MAPA - PISO 1" (floor digit = SCREEN_MAPA_AT_MAPA_PISO_1 + 12). Rows 1-16, cols
; 2-17: one tile per cell: (x, y) -> screen row 1 + y, col 2 + x. Row 17 "B: VOLVER".
; Cell tiles: not seen BLANK, WALL AM_WALL, FLOOR AM_FLOOR, DOOR AM_DOOR, LOCKED AM_LOCKED,
; DOOR_OPEN AM_OPEN, UP AM_UP, DOWN AM_DOWN. Hero = arrow SPRITE (OAM 0, spr.tiles arrows,
; pixel-artist) at screen x = (2 + px) * 8, y = (1 + py) * 8, 8x16 mode: top half = arrow,
; bottom half blank. The sprite below is a stand-in (ui:CURSOR = facing E).
; Sample: start of the floor explored, door (7,3) opened.
tilesets: ui font
legend:
w AM_WALL
, AM_FLOOR
d AM_DOOR
l AM_LOCKED
u AM_UP
x AM_DOWN
o AM_OPEN
- DASH
: COLON
